OL,3,GNEWSA'The Budget needs to help us
OL,4,Aemploy more apprentices'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I have a thick pile of CVs at the
OL,7,Foffice, and I want to give them all a
OL,8,Fjob, but we can't," says restaurant
OL,9,Fco-owner Jamshid Golshan Ebrahimi.
OL,11,FAhead of Wednesday's Budget, he and his
OL,12,Fwife Sally Butcher are calling on the
OL,13,Fchancellor for more subsidies for
OL,14,Fapprentices, so they can employ more
OL,15,Fyoung people, as well as a cut in
OL,16,FNational Insurance (NI) contributions
OL,17,Fto help their business survive.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32302
