OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1793084217
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'The Budget needs to help us
OL,4,Aemploy more apprentices'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey say that since NI rises were
OL,7,Fannounced in the 2024 budget, the
OL,8,Feffects have been "even worse" than
OL,9,Fexpected for their restaurant and shop
OL,10,FPersepolis in Peckham, south-east
OL,11,FLondon, as their take-home pay has gone
OL,12,Fdown by 25%.
OL,14,FEbrahimi said his business was only
OL,15,Fsurviving because they were working "80
OL,16,For 90 hours a week".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
